    "description": "Audits any webpage for AI search readiness and generates a comprehensive GEO report covering AI crawler accessibility, Core Web Vitals, schema markup, content structure, and citation readiness — with a prioritized action plan to improve your visibility in AI-powered search engines like ChatGPT, Perplexity, and Google AI Overviews. Best for quick, repeatable GEO checks across any page type.",
